  - have {Xj} [s₀ [s₀' [s₀'' Xj]]] : ∑ s s' s'', wf_judgment3 Σ Γ Γ' Γ'' (j_vass_s na A s) (j_vass_s na' A' s') (j_vass_s na'' A'' s'') with P, Ps.
    { destruct Xj; eexists _, _, _; econstructor; cbnr; eauto. }
    econstructor; cbn; auto. 1: by constructor.
